{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0514_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "6c48ed99a8b81e663d52687af57250f628929b970d3d7cffab378d7296679dac", "ja": "{$P$}さん……着て、みました……\nどう……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……我穿上试了试……怎么样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0514_1002_p", "source_sha256": "bbbb48ec89485f532c8b235edbffba134a6177ad804552792ce7e801714f7d12", "ja": "ああ、よく似合ってるよ。\n今度杏奈が演じる役にもぴったりじゃないか。", "zh": "啊，很适合你。\n也和杏奈这次要饰演的角色很相称。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0514_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "2bd1e791561b5a3e21d0ce41d652c6a8fae1667a051c99fde3c00b168ed9f2b1", "ja": "えへへ……。今回の役、髪の色も違うから……\nいつもの杏奈とは、雰囲気……変わるね……。", "zh": "嘿嘿……这次的角色，连发色都不一样……\n和往常的杏奈相比，感觉……会变呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0514_1004_p", "source_sha256": "cb02d16b15f559b1aaf60b2fe9b6f245169f75fba852e629209726e392e7a08b", "ja": "そうだな。ファンの人たちもビックリするかもな。\nでもきっと、喜んでくれると思う。", "zh": "是啊。粉丝们可能也会吓一跳吧。\n不过，我想他们一定会很开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0514_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "5af23f24345dcd49a76fcc31a0ecf3c02a2976dee32e05ed14c5cb2ff5f8256e", "ja": "うん……杏奈も、そう思います……。\nえへへ……～～～♪", "zh": "嗯……杏奈也，这么觉得……\n诶嘿嘿……～～～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0514_1007_p", "source_sha256": "45f4bc1b9b0c412f6c9bfb2f8b4287f1a5cfb621c6a51257defa321c16f3ce20", "ja": "どうした？　動きにくいところでもあったか？", "zh": "怎么了？是有哪里活动不方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0514_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "e7d708c4e95de78d9b6c635548fa7a9227bdf96c1ad07a362a22d7383ae8f6c0", "ja": "ううん……。その、杏奈が演じる子……\nきっと、こういう服、着たことないのかなって……。", "zh": "没有……那个，杏奈演的这个孩子……\n我想，她一定没有穿过这样的衣服吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0514_1009_p", "source_sha256": "60b783db7596c1f1eb99812ce1dfcc36df81ffa142942e58bc5be47cb7e1698b", "ja": "両親を亡くして、ナオに会うまで一人で生きてきたって\n資料にあったな。綺麗な服はたぶん初めてだろうな。", "zh": "资料里写着，她失去双亲后，一直独自生活，直到遇见奈绪。漂亮的衣服应该还是第一次穿吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0514_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "442e57543909ad590810d7a442d28c0aa5056ec4065afc99f81bceba4d17a795", "ja": "そっか……。\nじゃあ、今みたいに喜んだら……変、だよね……。", "zh": "这样啊……  \n那要是像刚才那样高兴……会很奇怪吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0514_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "70e8b3d32140b45c36ef1f0bb37c1d5b3459fa44a8ad23416633b3dfb3061606", "ja": "杏奈は、すごく嬉しいけど……\nちょっと、ガマン……？", "zh": "杏奈虽然特别开心……但还是稍微忍耐一下……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0514_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e4ede24d537def075f631d8a1dfa37f0cb615b4e16af8ae86dc60d24ae0bafb5", "ja": "そうだな。最初は心を閉ざしてるみたいだし、\nちょっと我慢だな。", "zh": "是啊。她一开始似乎还封闭着内心，所以得稍微忍耐一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0514_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "7d85df57b56679c8bd4874b155cf68ef2ca38f0631566ee4c60ac28af4caea4c", "ja": "ん……わかった……。ビックリ、したよね……\nナオさんに、助けてもらって……素敵な服をもらって。", "zh": "嗯……我知道了……吓了一跳、对吧……\n被奈绪小姐救下……还拿到了漂亮的衣服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0514_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "721a8f51c3f605cc195086784fd207dd354da97ffdb10b9300092dcd684da7c8", "ja": "はじめは、わからなくても……きっと、気づくよね\n……？　ナオさんの気持ち……。", "zh": "一开始就算没能明白……也一定会察觉到的吧……？\n……奈绪小姐的心意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0514_1015_p", "source_sha256": "95639ae8dcbfb36b10583ca24081e15c90b057a68cf46b5f2644bac3e9a6c0be", "ja": "ああ。少し難しいかもしれないけど、大丈夫そうか？", "zh": "嗯，可能会有点难，不过你应该没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
